f the most-bargained product\n32. Scroll to Just Bargained section\n33. Capture the name and city of the latest live order\n34. Click on View All link in Just Bargained Product section\n35. Identify the cheapest product among the most-bargained products\n36. Click on Toys and Games category tab\n37. Click on SERA'S BASKET brand from the left filter\n38. Click on price range filter and set from 427 to 727\n39. Click on Classic 15.7 Inch Soft Tip Dartboard Game Set from search results\n40. Click on the selected product\n41. Click on Bargain button to start bargaining\n42. Enter bargain offer and submit\n43. Wait for seller response to bargain offer\n44. Enter another bargain offer and submit\n45. Wait for seller response to bargain offer\n46. Enter final bargain offer and submit\n47. Wait for seller response to bargain offer\n48. Click on Accept button to accept the final bargain offer\n49. Click on Buy Now button\n50. Click on Pay Online payment option\n51. Click on Pay button\n52. Click on Net Banking option\n53. Click on a bank from the list\n54. Complete payment on bank portal\n55. Click on Success button to confirm payment\n56. Verify order placed successfully message\n57. Verify order details are displayed\n58. Navigate to My Bargains section\n59. Verify the savings displayed\n60. Verify bargained product is listed in My Bargains\n61. Verify deal details match the bargained offer\n62. Logout from the application\n63. Verify logout successful message",
